msgstr ""
"Deze extra knoppen zijn: :guilabel:`Mailing verzenden` en :guilabel:`sms "
"verzenden`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:768
msgid "Campaign form"
msgstr "Campagneformulier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:770
msgid ""
"On the campaign form (after clicking :guilabel:`Edit` from the Kanban card, "
