"pagina :guilabel:`Campagnes`) zijn er extra opties en metrieken beschikbaar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:773
msgid "View of the campaign form in Odoo Email Marketing."
msgstr "Weergave van het campagneformulier in Odoo E-mailmarketing."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:777
msgid ""
"At the top of the form, various smart buttons can be seen that showcase "
"specific analytics related to the campaign. Those smart buttons "
"are: :guilabel:`Revenues`, :guilabel:`Quotations`, :guilabel:`Opportunities`, "
"and :guilabel:`Clicks`."
msgstr ""
"Bovenaan het formulier staan verschillende slimme knoppen die specifieke "
"analyses met betrekking tot de campagne tonen. Deze slimme knoppen "
"zijn: :guilabel:`Opbrengsten`, :guilabel:`Offertes`, :guilabel:`Kansen` "
