msgstr ""
"Selecteer :guilabel:`Aanmaken` om deze nieuwe mailingcampagne aan de "
"database toe te voegen en de instellingen in de toekomst te wijzigen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:808
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Create and Edit...` to add this new mailing campaign to "
"the database, and reveal a :guilabel:`Create Campaign` pop-up window."
