"Selecteer :guilabel:`Aanmaken en bewerken...` om deze nieuwe mailingcampagne "
"aan de database toe te voegen en een :guilabel:`Campagne aanmaken`-pop-"
"upvenster te openen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:811
msgid ""
"View of the email mailing campaign pop-up window in Odoo Email Marketing "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Weergave van het pop-upvenster van een e-mailcampagne in Odoo's E-"
"mailmarketing applicatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:815
msgid ""
"Here, the new mailing campaign can be further customized. Users can adjust "
"the :guilabel:`Campaign Name`, assign a :guilabel:`Responsible`, and "
"add :guilabel:`Tags`."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan de nieuwe mailingcampagne verder worden aangepast. Gebruikers "
"kunnen de :guilabel:`Campagnenaam` aanpassen, "
"een :guilabel:`Verantwoordelijke` toewijzen en :guilabel:`Labels` toevoegen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:818
msgid ""
"Buttons to :guilabel:`Add Post` or :guilabel:`Send Push` (push "
"notifications) are also available."
msgstr ""
"Knoppen om :guilabel:`Bericht toevoegen` of :guilabel:`Push versturen` "
