msgid ""
"Records displayed in the List view can be narrowed down using :ref:`grouping "
"<events/tracks-dashboard/group>` and :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/"
"filter>` options."
msgstr ""
"Records die in de lijstweergave worden getoond, kunnen worden verfijnd "
"met :ref:`groeperings <events/tracks-dashboard/group>`- "
"en :ref:`filteropties <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>`."

