"For more information about using the List view, see the :ref:`List <studio/"
"views/multiple-records/list>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Voor meer informatie over het gebruik van de lijstweergave, zie "
"de :ref:`Lijst <studio/views/multiple-records/list>`-documentatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:84
msgid "Gantt"
msgstr "Gantt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:86
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`(Gantt)` view displays all tracks as "
"horizontal bars against an adjustable timeline, providing the user a "
"chronological view of their tracks' progress."
msgstr ""
"De :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`(Gantt)` weergave toont alle tracks als "
"horizontale balken tegen een aanpasbare tijdlijn. Dit biedt de gebruiker een "
"chronologisch overzicht van de voortgang van hun tracks."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:89
msgid "Gantt view in the events tracks page for an event."
msgstr "Gantt-weergave op de evenement tracks-pagina voor een evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:95
msgid ""
"For more information about using the Gantt view, see the :ref:`Gantt <studio/"
"views/timeline/gantt>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Zie de :ref:`Gantt <studio/views/timeline/gantt>` documentatie voor meer "
"informatie over het gebruik van de Gantt-weergave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/multi_slots.rst:54
