msgstr "Agenda"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:100
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(Calendar)` view displays all tracks for "
"the selected event as clickable entries in a calendar view, providing users "
"an interactive schedule by day, week, month, or year."
msgstr ""
"De :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`Agenda`-weergave toont alle tracks voor "
"het geselecteerde evenement als aanklikbare items in een agendaweergave, "
"waardoor gebruikers een interactief schema per dag, week, maand of jaar "
"krijgen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:104
msgid "Calendar view in the events tracks page for an event."
msgstr "Agendaweergave op de evenementtracks-pagina voor een evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:107
msgid ""
"Records displayed in the Calendar view can be narrowed down "
"using :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>` options."
msgstr ""
"Records die in de agendaweergave worden getoond, kunnen worden verfijnd "
"met :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>`-opties."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:110
msgid ""
"For more information about using the Calendar view, see the :ref:`Calendar "
"<studio/views/timeline/calendar>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Voor meer informatie over het gebruik van de agendaweergave, zie "
"de :ref:`Agenda <studio/views/timeline/calendar>`-documentatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:113
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:24
