msgstr "Grafiek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` view allows users to visually "
"compare tracks-related data for the selected event using multiple different "
"charts."
msgstr ""
"De :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`Grafiek`-weergave stelt gebruikers in "
"staat om visueel tracks-gerelateerde gegevens voor het geselecteerde "
"evenement te vergelijken met behulp van verschillende grafieken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:118
msgid "Graph view in the events tracks page for an event."
msgstr "Grafiekweergave op de evenementtracks-pagina voor een evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:121
msgid ""
"Records displayed in the Graph view can be narrowed down "
"using :ref:`grouping <events/tracks-dashboard/group>` and :ref:`filter "
"<events/tracks-dashboard/filter>` options."
msgstr ""
"Records die in de grafiekweergave worden getoond, kunnen worden verfijnd "
"met :ref:`groepeer <events/tracks-dashboard/group>`- en :ref:`filter <events/"
"tracks-dashboard/filter>`-opties."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:124
msgid ""
"For more information about using the Graph view, see the :ref:`Graph <studio/"
"views/reporting/graph>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Voor meer informatie over het gebruik van de grafiekweergave, zie "
"de :ref:`Grafiek <studio/views/reporting/graph>`-documentatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:127
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Activiteit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:129
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activity)` view displays a table of all "
"scheduled activities linked to tracks for the selected event."
msgstr ""
"De :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Activiteit`-weergave toont een tabel van "
"alle geplande activiteiten die zijn gekoppeld aan tracks voor het "
"geselecteerde evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:132
msgid "Activity view in the events tracks page for an event."
msgstr "Activiteitenweergave op de evenementtracks-pagina voor een evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:135
msgid ""
"Records displayed in the Activity view can be narrowed down "
"using :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>` options."
msgstr ""
"Records die in de activiteitenweergave worden getoond, kunnen worden "
"verfijnd met :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>`-opties."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:138
msgid ""
"For more information about using the Activity view, see the :ref:`Activity "
"<studio/views/general/activity>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Voor meer informatie over het gebruik van de activiteitenweergave, zie "
"de :ref:`Activiteit <studio/views/general/activity>`-documentatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:144
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:116
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:68
msgid "Filter options"
msgstr "Filteropties"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:146
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Filters` column in the search bar's drop-down menu filters "
"track-related data by specific criteria in any given view. Multiple filters "
"can be selected at once."
msgstr ""
"De kolom :guilabel:`Filters` in het vervolgkeuzemenu van de zoekbalk filtert "
"track-gerelateerde gegevens op specifieke criteria in elke weergave. "
"Meerdere filters kunnen tegelijk worden geselecteerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:149
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:121
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:76
msgid "The :guilabel:`Filters` column has the following options:"
msgstr "De kolom :guilabel:`Filters` heeft de volgende opties:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Tracks`: Filter by tracks with the *Responsible* user set to "
"the current user profile."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mijn tracks`: Filter op tracks waarbij het veld "
"*Verantwoordelijke* is ingesteld op het huidige gebruikersprofiel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:153
msgid ":guilabel:`Published`: Filter by published tracks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gepubliceerd`: Filter op gepubliceerde tracks."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Always Wishlisted`: Filter by tracks with the *Always Wishlisted* "
"field enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Altijd op verlanglijst`: Filter op tracks waarbij het veld "
"*Altijd op verlanglijst* is ingeschakeld."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:155
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Track Date`: Filter by a specific track date. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` :guilabel:`(down)` arrow to reveal a list of month, quarter, and "
"year options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Trackdatum`: Filter op een specifieke trackdatum. Klik op "
"de :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`naar beneden`-pijl om een lijst met "
"maand-, kwartaal- en jaaropties te tonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:157
msgid ":guilabel:`Archived`: Filter by archived tracks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gearchiveerd`: Filter op gearchiveerde tracks."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Filter...`: Create and apply a :ref:`custom filter <search/"
"custom-filters>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aangepast filter...`: Maak en pas een :ref:`aangepast filter "
"<search/custom-filters>` toe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:163
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:143
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:98
msgid "Group By options"
msgstr "Opties voor groeperen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:165
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Group By` column in the search bar's drop-down menu groups "
"track-related data by specific criteria in the Kanban, List, Gantt, and "
"Graph views only. Multiple grouping options can be selected at once."
msgstr ""
"De kolom :guilabel:`Groeperen op` in het vervolgkeuzemenu van de zoekbalk "
"groepeert trackgerelateerde gegevens op specifieke criteria in alleen de "
"Kanban-, Lijst-, Gantt- en Grafiekweergaven. Meerdere groeperingsopties "
"kunnen tegelijk worden geselecteerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:169
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:151
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:105
msgid "The :guilabel:`Group By` column has the following options:"
msgstr "De kolom :guilabel:`Groeperen` heeft de volgende opties:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:171
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: Group data by the *Responsible* user specified "
"across all tracks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Verantwoordelijke`: Groepeer gegevens op de *Verantwoordelijke* "
"gebruiker die is opgegeven voor alle tracks."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:172
msgid ":guilabel:`Stage`: Group data by stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fase`: Groepeer gegevens op fase."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:173
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Group data by a specific date. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(down)` arrow to reveal a list of day, week, month, "
"quarter, and year options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Datum`: Groepeer gegevens op een specifieke datum. Klik op "
"het :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(omlaag)` pijltje om een lijst met "
"dag-, week-, maand-, kwartaal- en jaaropties te tonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:175
msgid ":guilabel:`Event`: Group data by event."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Evenement`: Groepeer gegevens op evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Location`: Group data by location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Locatie`: Groepeer gegevens op locatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:177
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Group...`: Group data by a :ref:`custom group <search/"
"group>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aangepaste groepering...`: Groepeer gegevens op "
"een :ref:`aangepaste groepering <search/group>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:182
msgid "Create event track"
msgstr "Evenement track aanmaken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:184
msgid ""
"To create a new event track, click :guilabel:`New` in the corner to reveal a "
"blank *Event Track* form."
msgstr ""
"Klik, om een nieuwe evenementtrack aan te maken, in de hoek "
"op :guilabel:`Nieuw` om een leeg *Evenementtrack*-formulier te openen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:187
msgid "Typical event track form in the Odoo Events application."
msgstr ""
"Typisch evenement track-formulier in de applicatie Evenementen van Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:190
msgid ""
"Start by giving this track a :guilabel:`Title`. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
"Geef deze track eerst een :guilabel:`Titel`. Dit veld is **verplicht**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:192
msgid ""
"Optionally, upload an image for the track to be displayed on the track's "
"webpage."
msgstr ""
"Upload optioneel een afbeelding voor de track die wordt weergegeven op de "
"webpagina van de track."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:194
msgid "Next, enter details for the track in the following fields:"
msgstr "Voer vervolgens details voor de track in de volgende velden in:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Track Date`: Using the calendar pop-over, specify the date and "
"time of the track."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Trackdatum`: Geef met behulp van de kalenderpop-over de datum en "
"tijd van de track op."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: Using the drop-down menu, specify the track location."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Locatie`: Geef via het vervolgkeuzemenu de locatie van de track "
"op."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:198
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: Enter the duration of the track in a `HH:MM` format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Duur`: Voer de duur van de track in het formaat `HH:MM` in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Always Wishlisted`: Specify whether to automatically set the "
"track as favorite for each registered attendee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Altijd op verlanglijst`: Geef aan of de track automatisch als "
"favoriet moet worden ingesteld voor elke geregistreerde deelnemer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:201
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: Select the database user responsible for managing "
"the track. By default, this field is assigned to the user who initially "
"created the track."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Verantwoordelijke`: Selecteer de databasegebruiker die "
"verantwoordelijk is voor het beheren van de track. Dit veld is standaard "
"toegewezen aan de gebruiker die de track oorspronkelijk heeft gemaakt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Event`: Select the track's associated event. By default, this "
"field is already populated with the event from the *Event Tracks* page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Evenement`: Selecteer het bijbehorende evenement van de track. "
"Dit veld is standaard al ingevuld met het evenement van de pagina "
"*Evenementtracks*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Select one or multiple tags for the track to add as "
"filters on the *Talks*"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labels`: Selecteer een of meerdere labels voor de track om als "
"filters toe te voegen aan de *Talks*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Select any relevant tags for the track to add as filters "
"on the *Talks* webpage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labels`: Selecteer relevante labels voor de track om als filters "
"toe te voegen aan de webpagina *Talks*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Agenda Color`: Select a color to represent the track on the "
"*Agenda* webpage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agendakleur`: Selecteer een kleur om het programma op de *Agenda*-"
"webpagina weer te geven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:210
msgid ""
"Locations can be used to designate names to physical areas (e.g., conference "
"rooms, building levels) of an event venue, allowing users to :ref:`display "
"track locations <events/additional-configs/location-display>` at in-person "
"events."
msgstr ""
"Locaties kunnen worden gebruikt om namen toe te wijzen aan fysieke ruimtes "
"(bijv. vergaderruimtes, verdiepingen) van een evenementenlocatie, zodat "
"gebruikers :ref:`tracklocaties kunnen weergeven <events/additional-configs/"
"location-display>` bij fysieke evenementen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:214
msgid ""
"To access a complete list of locations for event tracks, which can be "
"modified (and added to) at any time, navigate to :menuselection:`Events app "
"--> Configuration --> Track Locations`."
msgstr ""
"Ga naar :menuselection:`Evenementen-app --> Configuratie --> Track Locaties` "
"om een volledige lijst van locaties voor evenement tracks te openen, die op "
"elk moment kan worden aangepast (en uitgebreid)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:220
msgid "Speaker tab"
msgstr "Sprekers-tabblad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:222
msgid ""
"The *Speaker* tab on an event track form contains various fields to "
"configure information about the track host or speaker."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad *Spreker* op een evenementtrackformulier bevat verschillende "
"velden om informatie over de gastheer of spreker van de track te "
"configureren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:225
msgid "The Speaker tab on an event track form in the Odoo Events application."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad Sprekers op een evenement track-formulier in de applicatie "
"Evenementen van Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:229
msgid "Contact details section"
msgstr "Sectie Contactgegevens"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:231
msgid ""
"In the *Contact Details* section, click the :guilabel:`Contact` drop-down "
"field to select an existing contact from the database as the main point of "
"contact for the talk."
msgstr ""
"Klik in de sectie :guilabel:`Contactgegevens` op het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu :guilabel:`Contact` om een bestaand contact uit de database "
"te selecteren als belangrijkste contactpersoon voor de presentatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:234
msgid ""
"If this contact is not yet in the database, type in the name of the contact, "
"and click :guilabel:`Create` to create and edit the contact form later. Or, "
"click :guilabel:`Create and edit...` to add the contact and configure the "
"rest of the contact details."
msgstr ""
"Als dit contact nog niet in de database staat, typ dan de naam van het "
"contact in en klik op :guilabel:`Aanmaken` om het contactformulier later aan "
"te maken en te bewerken. Of klik op :guilabel:`Aanmaken en bewerken...` om "
"het contact toe te voegen en de rest van de contactgegevens te configureren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:238
msgid ""
"Click the event track breadcrumb to return to the *Event Track* form. "
"The :guilabel:`Contact Email` and :guilabel:`Contact Phone` fields are "
"populated with the information on the selected contact form. These fields "
"**cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
"Klik op het broodkruimelpad van de evenementtrack om terug te keren naar het "
"formulier *Evenementtrack*. De velden :guilabel:`E-mail contactpersoon` "
"en :guilabel:`Telefoon contactpersoon` worden automatisch ingevuld met de "
"gegevens op het geselecteerde contactformulier. Deze velden kunnen **niet** "
"worden gewijzigd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:243
msgid "Speaker bio section"
msgstr "Sectie Biografie spreker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:245
msgid ""
"In the *Speaker Bio* section, enter any information related to the specific "
"speaker scheduled to conduct or host the track."
msgstr ""
"Voer in de sectie *Biografie spreker* alle informatie in over de specifieke "
"spreker die gepland staat om de track te verzorgen of te presenteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:248
msgid ""
"If the chosen contact in the *Contact Details* section is properly "
"configured, the :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Phone` "
"fields are automatically populated. Otherwise, manually enter the "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Als het gekozen contact in de sectie :guilabel:`Contactgegevens` correct is "
"geconfigureerd, worden de velden :guilabel:`Naam`, :guilabel:`E-mail` "
"en :guilabel:`Telefoon` automatisch ingevuld. Voer anders de informatie "
"handmatig in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:253
msgid ""
"This information appears on the front-end of the event website, on the "
"specific track webpage, providing more information about the speaker to the "
"track attendees."
msgstr ""
"Deze informatie verschijnt op de frontend van de evenementwebsite, op de "
"specifieke track-webpagina, en biedt de track-deelnemers meer informatie "
"over de spreker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:256
msgid ""
"Optionally, upload an image to appear alongside the speaker biography on the "
"event website."
msgstr ""
"Upload optioneel een afbeelding die naast de sprekerbiografie op de "
"evenementwebsite wordt weergegeven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:258
msgid ""
"Then, enter a :guilabel:`Job Position` for the designated speaker, followed "
"by the :guilabel:`Company Name` associated with the speaker."
msgstr ""
"Voer vervolgens een :guilabel:`Functie` in voor de aangewezen spreker, "
"gevolgd door de :guilabel:`Bedrijfsnaam` die bij de spreker hoort."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:261
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Biography` field, enter a custom biography with any "
"speaker-related information."
msgstr ""
"Voer in het veld :guilabel:`Biografie` een aangepaste biografie in met "
"informatie over de spreker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:266
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/surveys/create.rst:258
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/surveys/questions.rst:198
msgid "Description tab"
msgstr "Tabblad Omschrijving"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:268
msgid ""
"The *Description* tab of an event track form contains a blank text field to "
"enter any additional information about the track. This information appears "
"on the specific track page on the event website."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad *Omschrijving* van een trackformulier bevat een leeg tekstveld "
"om extra informatie over de track in te voeren. Deze informatie verschijnt "
"op de specifieke trackpagina op de website van het evenement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:275
msgid "Interactivity tab"
msgstr "Tabblad Interactiviteit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:277
msgid ""
"The *Interactivity* tab of the track form provides users with the option to "
"display an interactive button for additional attendee engagement."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad *Interactiviteit* van het trackformulier biedt gebruikers de "
"optie om een interactieve knop weer te geven voor extra betrokkenheid van "
"deelnemers."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:280
msgid ""
"The Interactivity tab on an event track form in the Odoo Events application."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad Interactiviteit op een evenement track-formulier in de "
"applicatie Evenementen van Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:283
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Magic Button` checkbox is enabled, Odoo displays a *call "
"to action* button for attendees on the sidebar of the track webpage while "
"the track is taking place."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer het selectievakje :guilabel:`Magische knop` is ingeschakeld, toont "
"Odoo tijdens de track een *call-to-action*-knop voor deelnemers in de "
"zijbalk van de trackwebpagina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:286
msgid "When enabled, three more options appear below to configure the button:"
msgstr ""
"Wanneer dit is ingeschakeld, verschijnen eronder drie extra opties om de "
"knop te configureren:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:288
msgid ":guilabel:`Button Title`: Enter a name for the button."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Knoptitel`: Voer een naam in voor de knop."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:289
msgid ":guilabel:`Button Target URL`: Enter the URL the button navigates to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Doel-URL knop`: Voer de URL in waar de knop naartoe leidt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:290
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show Button`: Enter how many :guilabel:`minutes after Track "
"start` the button should appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Knop weergeven`: Voer in hoeveel :guilabel:`minuten na start "
"programma` de knop moet verschijnen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:294
msgid ""
"The magic button **only** appears if there is more than one published track."
msgstr ""
"De magische knop verschijnt **alleen** als er meer dan één gepubliceerde "
"track is."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:297
msgid "Publish event track"
msgstr "Evenement track publiceren"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:299
msgid ""
"Once all the desired configurations are complete on an event track form, "
"publish the track in one of three ways:"
msgstr ""
"Zodra alle gewenste configuraties op een trackformulier zijn voltooid, "
"publiceer je de track op een van de volgende drie manieren:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:302
msgid ""
"On the individual *Track* page. Click the :guilabel:`Published` stage above "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"Op de individuele pagina *Track*. Klik op de fase :guilabel:`Gepubliceerd` "
"boven het formulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:303
msgid ""
"On the main *Event Tracks* dashboard. Drag-and-drop the Kanban card to "
"the :guilabel:`Published` stage."
msgstr ""
"Op het hoofddashboard *Tracks van het evenement*. Sleep de Kanbankaart naar "
"de fase :guilabel:`Gepubliceerd`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:305
msgid ""
"On the *Event Track* webpage. On the *Event Track* form, click the :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button. Then, toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Unpublished` :icon:`fa-toggle-off` button at the top of the "
"page. The button changes to :guilabel:`Published` :icon:`fa-toggle-on` and "
"the event is published. event website by clicking the :guilabel:`Published` "
"stage in the upper corner."
msgstr ""
"Op de webpagina *Track van evenement*. Klik op het formulier *Track van "
"evenement* op de slimme knop :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Naar website gaan`. "
"Schakel vervolgens de knop :guilabel:`Niet gepubliceerd` :icon:`fa-toggle-"
"off` bovenaan de pagina om. De knop verandert "
"in :guilabel:`Gepubliceerd` :icon:`fa-toggle-on` en het evenement is "
"gepubliceerd. evenementenwebsite door in de bovenhoek op de "
"fase :guilabel:`Gepubliceerd` te klikken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:310
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:45
msgid ""
"The track-related event submenu options on an event website built with Odoo "
"Events."
msgstr ""
"De track-gerelateerde submenu-opties voor evenementen op een "
"evenementenwebsite gebouwd met Odoo Evenementen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:316
msgid "Additional configurations"
msgstr "Aanvullende configuraties"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:318
msgid ""
"Users can configure additional options on specific tracks, including live "
"broadcasting, gamification, and displaying track schedules for specific "
"events on physical screens at in-person venues."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikers kunnen aanvullende opties voor specifieke tracks configureren, "
"zoals live-uitzendingen, gamificatie en het weergeven van trackroosters voor "
"specifieke evenementen op fysieke schermen op locatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:325
msgid "Live broadcasting"
msgstr "Live uitzenden"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:327
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Live Broadcast` setting is enabled in the **Events** app "
"settings, the option to add a corresponding link in the :guilabel:`YouTube "
"Video Link` field appears in the track form."
msgstr ""
"Als de instelling :guilabel:`Live uitzenden` is ingeschakeld in de "
"instellingen van de app **Evenementen**, verschijnt de optie om een "
"bijbehorende link toe te voegen in het veld :guilabel:`YouTube-videolink` in "
"het trackformulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:333
msgid "Event gamification"
msgstr "Gamificatie van evenementen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:335
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Event Gamification` setting is enabled, an :guilabel:`Add "
"Quiz` button appears at the top of a track form, allowing the user to create "
"a quiz for attendees to complete after the track ends."
msgstr ""
"Als de instelling :guilabel:`Evenementgamificatie` is ingeschakeld, "
"verschijnt er bovenaan een trackformulier een knop :guilabel:`Quiz "
"toevoegen`, waarmee de gebruiker een quiz kan maken die deelnemers na afloop "
"van de track kunnen invullen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:340
msgid "Track quiz form"
msgstr "Trackquizformulier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:342
msgid ""
"To add a quiz to the event track, click the :guilabel:`Add Quiz` button. "
"Doing so opens a form to configure the quiz."
msgstr ""
"Klik op de knop :guilabel:`Quiz toevoegen` om een quiz aan de evenementtrack "
"toe te voegen. Er verschijnt een formulier om de quiz te configureren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:345
msgid "The Add Quiz page in the Odoo Events application for an event track."
msgstr ""
"De pagina Quiz toevoegen in de applicatie Evenementen van Odoo voor een "
"evenement track."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:348
msgid ""
"Start by entering a title for the quiz in the blank field at the top of the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Voer eerst een titel voor de quiz in het lege veld bovenaan de pagina in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:350
msgid ""
"If participants are allowed to take the quiz multiple times, tick the "
"checkbox beside :guilabel:`Allow multiple tries`."
msgstr ""
"Als deelnemers de quiz meerdere keren mogen maken, vink je het selectievakje "
"naast :guilabel:`Meerdere pogingen toestaan` aan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:353
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Event` and :guilabel:`Event Track` fields are automatically "
"populated with the corresponding event and track. These fields are non-"
"modifiable."
msgstr ""
"De velden :guilabel:`Evenement` en :guilabel:`Evenementtrack` worden "
"automatisch ingevuld met het bijbehorende evenement en de bijbehorende "
"track. Deze velden kun je niet wijzigen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:357
msgid "Add questions and answers"
msgstr "Vragen en antwoorden toevoegen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:359
msgid ""
"To add questions to the quiz, click :guilabel:`Add a line` beneath "
"the :guilabel:`Question` column. Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Create "
"Questions` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Regel toevoegen` onder de kolom :guilabel:`Vraag` om "
"vragen aan de quiz toe te voegen. Dit opent een pop-"
"upvenster :guilabel:`Vragen aanmaken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:363
msgid "**All** track quiz questions are multiple choice."
msgstr "**Alle** track quizvragen zijn meerkeuzevragen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:365
msgid ""
"From the pop-up window, enter the question in the blank field at the top. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add an answer option."
msgstr ""
"Voer in het pop-upvenster de vraag in het lege veld bovenaan in. Klik "
"vervolgens op :guilabel:`Regel toevoegen` om een antwoordoptie toe te voegen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:368
msgid "Optionally, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "Vul optioneel de volgende velden in:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:370
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Correct`: Designate whether the option is the correct response."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Juist`: Geef aan of de optie het juiste antwoord is."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:371
msgid ":guilabel:`Points`: Specify a point value for the answer option."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Punten`: Geef een puntwaarde op voor de antwoordoptie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:372
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Comment`: Add any additional comments that should accompany "
"the answer option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Extra opmerking`: Voeg eventuele aanvullende opmerkingen toe die "
"bij de antwoordoptie horen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:374
msgid ""
"The Create Questions pop-up window on an event-specific track quiz in the "
"Odoo Events app."
msgstr ""
"Het pop-upvenster Vragen aanmaken bij een evenement-specifieke track quiz in "
"de app Evenementen van Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:377
msgid ""
"Once all desired answer options are completed, click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close` to save the question, close the pop-up window, and return to the "
"track quiz form. Or, click :guilabel:`Save & New` to save this question and "
"instantly start creating another question on a new :guilabel:`Create "
"Questions` pop-up form."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Opslaan & sluiten` zodra alle gewenste antwoordopties "
"zijn ingevuld om de vraag op te slaan, het pop-upvenster te sluiten en terug "
"te keren naar het trackquizformulier. Klik op :guilabel:`Opslaan & nieuw` om "
"deze vraag op te slaan en direct een nieuwe vraag te maken in een nieuw pop-"
"upvenster :guilabel:`Vragen maken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:385
msgid "Track location display"
msgstr "Tracklocatie weergeven"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:387
msgid ""
"When a :guilabel:`Location` is specified on a :ref:`track form <events/"
"event_tracks/create-track>`, Odoo generates a display page showing all "
"scheduled tracks at the specified location, starting from the user's current "
"date and time. This page can be left open on a screen or kiosk at the "
"physical location."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer een :guilabel:`Locatie` is opgegeven op een :ref:`trackformulier "
"<events/event_tracks/create-track>`, genereert Odoo een weergavepagina met "
"alle geplande tracks op de opgegeven locatie, te beginnen vanaf de huidige "
"datum en tijd van de gebruiker. Deze pagina kan open blijven staan op een "
"scherm of kiosk op de fysieke locatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:395
msgid ""
"To begin, ensure that the *Event Location Display* module is installed in "
"Odoo **Apps**."
msgstr ""
"Zorg er om te beginnen voor dat de module *Event Location Display* is "
"geïnstalleerd in Odoo **Apps**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:397
msgid ""
"Additionally, to ensure that a track appears on the display page, verify "
"that the following options are configured:"
msgstr ""
"Controleer bovendien of de volgende opties zijn geconfigureerd om ervoor te "
"zorgen dat een track op de weergavepagina verschijnt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:400
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Showcase Tracks` option is enabled for the track's respective "
"event. :doc:`Developer mode <../../../general/developer_mode>` **must** be "
"enabled to access this setting on an event form."
msgstr ""
"De optie :guilabel:`Tracks onder de aandacht brengen` is ingeschakeld voor "
"het betreffende evenement van de track. De :doc:`Ontwikkelaarsmodus "
"<../../../general/developer_mode>` **moet** zijn ingeschakeld om toegang te "
"krijgen tot deze instelling op een evenementenformulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:403
msgid "Both the event website **and** the track must be published."
msgstr "Zowel de evenementenwebsite **als** de track moeten gepubliceerd zijn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:406
msgid "Access location displays"
msgstr "Locatieweergaven bekijken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:408
msgid ""
"To access track location pages, click the :icon:`fa-map-"
"marker` :guilabel:`Track Locations` smart button at the top of an event "
"form. This opens the *Event Locations* dashboard, which lists "
"each :guilabel:`Location` and its :guilabel:`Location Display Link`."
msgstr ""
"Om de pagina's van tracklocaties te openen, klik je op de slimme "
"knop :icon:`fa-map-marker` :guilabel:`Tracklocaties` bovenaan een "
"evenementenformulier. Dit opent het dashboard *Evenementlocaties*, waarin "
"elke :guilabel:`Locatie` en de bijbehorende :guilabel:`Link locatieweergave` "
"worden vermeld."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:412
msgid "Event Locations page in Odoo Events."
msgstr "Pagina Evenementlocaties in Odoo Evenementen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:415
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Location Display Link` to open the location's display "
"page. The date and location name are displayed at the upper corner. Upcoming "
"tracks are displayed below, including their scheduled time, title, and "
"speaker name."
msgstr ""
"Klik op de :guilabel:`Link locatieweergave` om de weergavepagina van de "
"locatie te openen. De datum en de locatienaam worden in de bovenhoek "
"weergegeven. Aankomende tracks worden eronder getoond, inclusief hun "
"geplande tijd, titel en de naam van de spreker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:420
msgid ""
"Track location display pages are **only** accessible to database users or "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"Weergavepagina's van tracklocaties zijn **alleen** toegankelijk voor "
"databasegebruikers of -beheerders."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:422
msgid "Track location display for an event location."
msgstr "Locatieweergave voor een evenementlocatie."

