#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prioritize Hot Leads`: Send an email to new leads and assign them "
"a high priority if they open it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Warme leads prioriteren`: Stuur een e-mail naar nieuwe leads en "
